(7407899, 1167009, 150277, '<td valign="top">Ewwww to the spider. Nice to the Bokeh.</td>', 'Ewwww to the spider. Nice to the Bokeh.', '2015-10-04 22:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408054, 1167078, 180676, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but that hand coming back into the shot with that cut off elbow is givin'' me such a strange feel, as is the cut off elbow on the other side.  Perhaps a different crop?</td>', 'Nice portrait, but that hand coming back into the shot with that cut off elbow is givin'' me such a strange feel, as is the cut off elbow on the other side.  Perhaps a different crop?', '2015-10-05 12:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408060, 1167000, 5891, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2015-10-05 13:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408062, 1167150, 38032, '<td valign="top">Assuming this is a real butterfly, it is interesting how it has become a piece of debris. A symptom of a creature that has paved the earth. Bumping up and dropping a yellow babyface your way <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png"/></a></td>', 'Assuming this is a real butterfly, it is interesting how it has become a piece of debris. A symptom of a creature that has paved the earth. Bumping up and dropping a yellow babyface your way ', '2015-10-05 13:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408089, 1167029, 58634, '<td valign="top">The bokeh in here is GORGEOUS and really enhances the softness and warmth of the leaf.</td>', 'The bokeh in here is GORGEOUS and really enhances the softness and warmth of the leaf.', '2015-10-05 15:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408090, 1167040, 58634, '<td valign="top">Love the warm colors here. The image itself is lovely, but not quite sure that it''s the best topic for "bokeh".</td>', 'Love the warm colors here. The image itself is lovely, but not quite sure that it''s the best topic for "bokeh".', '2015-10-05 15:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408091, 1167063, 58634, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous.', '2015-10-05 15:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408092, 1167039, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautifully achieved perfect focus on its eye.  However, I find myself wishing for "more" bokeh.</td>', 'Beautifully achieved perfect focus on its eye.  However, I find myself wishing for "more" bokeh.', '2015-10-05 15:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408093, 1166803, 58634, '<td valign="top">Your bokeh effect is nice, but not sure that it enhances the main subject as it in itself seems vague. Also, I would personally bump up the contrast to bring out the color of the grass a little bit more.</td>', 'Your bokeh effect is nice, but not sure that it enhances the main subject as it in itself seems vague. Also, I would personally bump up the contrast to bring out the color of the grass a little bit more.', '2015-10-05 15:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408094, 1167067, 58634, '<td valign="top">Really fun image. I like how you can almost feel the movement in his wings in the overall feel of the picture.</td>', 'Really fun image. I like how you can almost feel the movement in his wings in the overall feel of the picture.', '2015-10-05 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408095, 1167043, 58634, '<td valign="top">Such a gorgeous little face, with a beautifully bright background to really make its face stand out. I love it!!</td>', 'Such a gorgeous little face, with a beautifully bright background to really make its face stand out. I love it!!', '2015-10-05 15:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408096, 1167111, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like how the web cuts diagonally across the picture.</td>', 'I like how the web cuts diagonally across the picture.', '2015-10-05 15:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408097, 1166813, 58634, '<td valign="top">Really nice image and a nice bokeh, however it feels unbalanced to me; as if the bottles could be more centered? Maybe it''s just my vision....</td>', 'Really nice image and a nice bokeh, however it feels unbalanced to me; as if the bottles could be more centered? Maybe it''s just my vision....', '2015-10-05 15:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408098, 1167073, 58634, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. I feel like a tighter crop would be more efficient with this though.</td>', 'Nice colors. I feel like a tighter crop would be more efficient with this though.', '2015-10-05 15:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408099, 1167001, 58634, '<td valign="top">The colors here definitely scream "FALL".</td>', 'The colors here definitely scream "FALL".', '2015-10-05 15:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408104, 1166925, 58634, '<td valign="top">Intense and very defining portrait.</td>', 'Intense and very defining portrait.', '2015-10-05 15:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408105, 1167023, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautifully focused.</td>', 'Beautifully focused.', '2015-10-05 16:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408106, 1167148, 58634, '<td valign="top">the background here seems a bit busy and distracting from the dragonfly, although in the same sense, it also adds dimension to the photograph.</td>', 'the background here seems a bit busy and distracting from the dragonfly, although in the same sense, it also adds dimension to the photograph.', '2015-10-05 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408107, 1167106, 58634, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous set of rings, and what a pretty setup.</td>', 'What a gorgeous set of rings, and what a pretty setup.', '2015-10-05 16:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408108, 1167113, 58634, '<td valign="top">This has great movement and the pup''s got a great expression. :)</td>', 'This has great movement and the pup''s got a great expression. :)', '2015-10-05 16:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408112, 1167046, 58634, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I don''t feel the image quite fits the challenge. Although you have a blurry background, I wouldn''t call it a bokeh.</td>', 'Unfortunately I don''t feel the image quite fits the challenge. Although you have a blurry background, I wouldn''t call it a bokeh.', '2015-10-05 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408113, 1166998, 58634, '<td valign="top">Like raindrops falling all around the flowers. I really like that background color.</td>', 'Like raindrops falling all around the flowers. I really like that background color.', '2015-10-05 16:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408114, 1167096, 58634, '<td valign="top">So soft.</td>', 'So soft.', '2015-10-05 16:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408115, 1167126, 58634, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture, but I don''t think you have an efficient bokeh.</td>', 'Really nice capture, but I don''t think you have an efficient bokeh.', '2015-10-05 16:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408116, 1167100, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like your pun and originality.</td>', 'I like your pun and originality.', '2015-10-05 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408117, 1167028, 58634, '<td valign="top">I think this photograph would look much better without such an awkward crop.</td>', 'I think this photograph would look much better without such an awkward crop.', '2015-10-05 16:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408118, 1167108, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the muted tones here and the way the fly looks almost iridescent, yet still subtle.</td>', 'I like the muted tones here and the way the fly looks almost iridescent, yet still subtle.', '2015-10-05 16:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408125, 1167125, 58634, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous bright colors.</td>', 'Gorgeous bright colors.', '2015-10-05 16:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408126, 1167000, 58634, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait. It gives this adorable koala so much personality!</td>', 'I really like this portrait. It gives this adorable koala so much personality!', '2015-10-05 16:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408202, 1167077, 58634, '<td valign="top">Makes you ponder...</td>', 'Makes you ponder...', '2015-10-06 00:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408203, 1167064, 58634, '<td valign="top">Such perfect focus, WOW!</td>', 'Such perfect focus, WOW!', '2015-10-06 00:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408204, 1166848, 58634, '<td valign="top">Simplistic, but it certainly looks like it comes from an enchanted land. Neat find. Great image and use of bokeh.</td>', 'Simplistic, but it certainly looks like it comes from an enchanted land. Neat find. Great image and use of bokeh.', '2015-10-06 00:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408205, 1167107, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the lightness that the bright background brings to this image.</td>', 'I like the lightness that the bright background brings to this image.', '2015-10-06 00:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408206, 1167115, 58634, '<td valign="top">I love all the subtle, different textures.</td>', 'I love all the subtle, different textures.', '2015-10-06 00:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408207, 1167009, 58634, '<td valign="top">This would be an awesome shot if it was slightly better focused. Spiders are tough though!</td>', 'This would be an awesome shot if it was slightly better focused. Spiders are tough though!', '2015-10-06 00:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408208, 1166972, 58634, '<td valign="top">It''s as if the ''bokeh'' factor adds a tired/hazy feel to the image.</td>', 'It''s as if the ''bokeh'' factor adds a tired/hazy feel to the image.', '2015-10-06 00:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408209, 1166815, 58634, '<td valign="top">Her hair is so long and flowy! Very playful pic.</td>', 'Her hair is so long and flowy! Very playful pic.', '2015-10-06 00:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408210, 1167057, 58634, '<td valign="top">Great find. The lights in the background give this little snail a city feel. As if he''s a tourist, back-packing through the city of New York.</td>', 'Great find. The lights in the background give this little snail a city feel. As if he''s a tourist, back-packing through the city of New York.', '2015-10-06 00:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408211, 1166855, 58634, '<td valign="top">The bokeh here is absolutely stunning. I''m not a big fan of this particular flower (generally speaking), but this image is great altogether.</td>', 'The bokeh here is absolutely stunning. I''m not a big fan of this particular flower (generally speaking), but this image is great altogether.', '2015-10-06 00:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408212, 1166926, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of crop here. I think ''most'' would go for a rule-of-thirds crop, but you went differently which is a nice change of pace.</td>', 'I like your choice of crop here. I think ''most'' would go for a rule-of-thirds crop, but you went differently which is a nice change of pace.', '2015-10-06 00:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408213, 1167047, 58634, '<td valign="top">Admiring beautiful melodies from the shadows...</td>', 'Admiring beautiful melodies from the shadows...', '2015-10-06 00:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408214, 1167143, 58634, '<td valign="top">Such a grunge feel to this! I like it!</td>', 'Such a grunge feel to this! I like it!', '2015-10-06 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408215, 1167079, 58634, '<td valign="top">Your caption=priceless and hilarious. <br/> <br/>You may hate bokeh, but you definitely achieved it perfectly here.</td>', 'Your caption=priceless and hilarious.  You may hate bokeh, but you definitely achieved it perfectly here.', '2015-10-06 00:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408216, 1167078, 58634, '<td valign="top">Overall a nice, thoughtful portrait. My only pet-peeve with this, and it''s minor, is the shirt that she''s wearing. It blends too well with her skin and it makes the image lose contrast and seem a bit awkward.</td>', 'Overall a nice, thoughtful portrait. My only pet-peeve with this, and it''s minor, is the shirt that she''s wearing. It blends too well with her skin and it makes the image lose contrast and seem a bit awkward.', '2015-10-06 00:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408217, 1167103, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, but not enough bokeh in my opinion.</td>', 'Beautiful image, but not enough bokeh in my opinion.', '2015-10-06 00:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408218, 1166859, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, with nice "faded-like" tones. However, I think that for this challenge, it just doesn''t have enough bokeh.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, with nice "faded-like" tones. However, I think that for this challenge, it just doesn''t have enough bokeh.', '2015-10-06 00:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408220, 1166892, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I thoroughly enjoy the movement in this and also think you were quite creative in your use of bokeh.</td>', 'Very cute. I thoroughly enjoy the movement in this and also think you were quite creative in your use of bokeh.', '2015-10-06 01:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408221, 1166935, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautifully focused image, but not for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully focused image, but not for this challenge.', '2015-10-06 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408222, 1167005, 58634, '<td valign="top">What a sad face :(</td>', 'What a sad face :(', '2015-10-06 01:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408223, 1167070, 58634, '<td valign="top">She is deep in the wood, and I am lost in this image..</td>', 'She is deep in the wood, and I am lost in this image..', '2015-10-06 01:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
